<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>There are millions in this world who are seeking</l><l>For pleasures earthly goods afford.</l><l>But none can match the wondrous treasure</l><l>That I find in Jesus Christ my Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>So my brother if the things that this world gives you</l><l>Leave hungers that won’t pass away,</l><l>My blessed Lord will come and save you</l><l>If you kneel to Him and humbly pray—</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
